type: text
aliases: linkaccount, globallinking, link, linking, globalink, globallink
title: :information_source: Account Linking
color: info

---
Global Linking is a central place for servers to see if a Bedrock player has a Java Edition account linked. By linking your account globally you don't need to link your Bedrock and Java accounts on every server you want to join.

- Information on how to use Global Linking can be found here: https://link.geysermc.org/
- Information on how to setup and use both Global Linking and Local Linking can be found here: https://wiki.geysermc.org/floodgate/linking/
- To unlink your accounts, join the Global Link Server on one of the linked accounts and use the `/unlink` command.